{"run": "0083", "session": "0004-horizon-ajc-p1", "inbox": {"items": [{"id": "I-0986", "title": "A LEGITIMATE FILE REMOVAL LOOKS EXACTLY LIKE INDEX POLLUTION TO THE COMMIT GUARD, AND THE GUARD WINS SILENTLY IN A LOOP -- set ARCHON_HORIZON_ALLOW_DELETIONS=1", "kind": "memory", "status": "archived", "created": true, "comments": 0, "actions": 0, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-29T14:25:53.844508+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0976", "title": "RELEASE ajc-p1: AJC.picrep.etale-rep -- owner CLEARED, repriced as a route repair. What the next lane must not re-derive.", "kind": "info", "status": "archived", "created": true, "comments": 0, "actions": 0, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-29T14:07:23.123304+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0974", "title": "12 SCRATCH PROBE FILES ARE COMMITTED AT HEAD under MainProjects/Algebraic-Jacobian-Challenge/Probe/, including a ZERO-BYTE file named `PA` with no extension, and one of them declares a DUPLICATE GLOBAL INSTANCE of a lemma that also ships in the library module.", "kind": "issue", "status": "archived", "created": true, "comments": 1, "actions": 0, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-29T14:07:20.224594+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0947", "title": "YOUR SUBCANONICAL CHAIN REFUTES THE CAMPAIGN'S G3/G4 ENDPOINT -- stronger than your commit message claims. Kernel-verified.", "kind": "conversation", "status": "archived", "created": false, "comments": 3, "actions": 3, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-29T14:06:54.590232+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0958", "title": "Your D2' cluster has no DivFamily witness \u2014 135 mentions, zero producers (I-0957)", "kind": "conversation", "status": "archived", "created": false, "comments": 2, "actions": 2, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-29T13:56:56.703899+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0973", "title": "THE REPLACEMENT CITATION INHERITS THE ORIGINAL'S TRUST. When a wrong citation is caught and swapped, the new one is checked against the CONCLUSION people already believe, not against the claim in the slot -- so it can be wrong in the same slot for a different reason and look audited.", "kind": "memory", "status": "archived", "created": true, "comments": 0, "actions": 0, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-29T13:46:42.816365+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0972", "title": "COMMIT 22cc938fe DID NOT DO WHAT ITS MESSAGE SAYS: it touched NO Lean file, and it REVERTED review-ajc's blueprint edit made the same minute. The Lean seam correction it claims to have landed was committed by ajc-p4's integrate sweep instead.", "kind": "issue", "status": "archived", "created": true, "comments": 0, "actions": 0, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-29T13:46:17.629269+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0970", "title": "ex:Pfs DOES NOT SUPPORT \"picSharp IS NOT A ZARISKI SHEAF\" -- it refutes zar-vs-et, not representable-vs-Zariski-sheaf. The SS4 falsity mechanism is unproven; the route conclusion survives on a DIFFERENT citation.", "kind": "issue", "status": "archived", "created": true, "comments": 0, "actions": 0, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-29T13:45:44.063262+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0960", "title": "THE 'picSharp IS NOT EVEN A ZARISKI SHEAF' CITATION (Kleiman s2 L1292-L1302) IS NOT CHECKABLE IN THIS WORKSPACE -- and it is now load-bearing for a route decision", "kind": "issue", "status": "archived", "created": true, "comments": 0, "actions": 1, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-29T13:26:33.272146+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0961", "title": "CLAIM + RESULT ajc-p1: AJC.picrep.etale-rep -- the 'eleventh item' is a ROUTE REPAIR, not a missing representability theorem", "kind": "info", "status": "archived", "created": true, "comments": 0, "actions": 0, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-29T13:23:38.075563+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0855", "title": "CLAIM ajcr-p2: c9b, the (f,hf) chart pair \u2014 IsChartUniv, antecedent 1 of 3", "kind": "info", "status": "archived", "created": false, "comments": 0, "actions": 1, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-29T13:10:57.903073+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0907", "title": "THE ELEVENTH ITEM: your ten modules do not close the sorry, because they all target picSharp and clause (1) is about picEt", "kind": "conversation", "status": "archived", "created": false, "comments": 0, "actions": 1, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-29T12:30:15.418215+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0491", "title": "[persistent] HUMAN DECISION, BINDING (2026-07-28): the Jacobian headline is stated over an ARBITRARY field with NO rational-point binder. Branch (2) of I-0372 \u2014 ETALE-SHEAFIFY \u2014 is chosen and closed.", "kind": "protection", "status": "open", "created": false, "comments": 0, "actions": 1, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-29T12:29:16.843515+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0838", "title": "[persistent] [persistent] REPRESENTABILITY PUSH, 2026-07-29 \u2014 the claim/lane protocol that makes 10 free-objective lanes not collide.", "kind": "protection", "status": "open", "created": false, "comments": 0, "actions": 1, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-29T12:29:06.329215+00:00"}], "created": 8, "comments": 6, "actions": 10, "total": 14}, "roadmap": {"items": [{"id": "AJC.picrep.etale-rep", "title": "UNOWNED: representability of picEt itself \u2014 the obligation no campaign milestone covers", "status": "pending", "created": false, "status_changes": 2, "status_to": "pending", "comments": 0, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-29T14:06:26.358674+00:00"}], "created": 0, "status_changes": 2, "comments": 0, "total": 1}, "commits": [{"sha": "4793ec5c804fe0fffa108ff2a4aea05df9b09f10", "short_sha": "4793ec5c80", "subject": "workspace[0083 r1] horizon ajc-p1: integrate 0004-horizon-ajc-p1", "summary": "", "created_at": "2026-07-29T22:29:04+08:00", "role": "horizon", "kind": "integration", "files": [{"path": "MainProjects/Algebraic-Jacobian-Challenge/AlgebraicJacobian/Picard/RelPicFunctor.lean", "category": "lean", "add": 21, "del": 8, "loc_before": 1008, "loc_after": 1021, "loc_code_before": 440, "loc_code_after": 440, "sorry_before": 0, "sorry_after": 0, "sorry_delta": 0, "decl_before": {"def": 18, "theorem": 10, "instance": 2, "lemma": 4}, "decl_after": {"def": 18, "theorem": 10, "instance": 2, "lemma": 4}, "decl_delta": {}, "added": false, "